     " is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "IVIMCorrectData"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "ee842e04-64df-ff46-9842-6eae66a04d64"],
     ". If ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["FilterMaps",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
