      "9214825e-65e8-244f-b788-0f2242287f84"],
     " it tells which filter to use. can be \"Median\" of \"Gaussian\"."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"f4601d85-3412-9843-af76-6b951cae54ff"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
