     " is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "IVIMCorrectData"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "c580d3c6-db23-e341-b42a-aee2f1e29c8c"],
     ". If ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["FilterMaps",
